WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Same amount. Different fractions.

00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
Shade one of two equal parts: one half.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Split every part in two. Two quarters cover the same amount as one half.

00:13.000 --> 00:19.000
Split every part again. Four eighths still cover the same amount.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.500
One half equals two quarters equals four eighths.
Multiply the top and bottom by the same number.

00:24.500 --> 00:28.500
Your turn: three fifths equals how many tenths?
